IsClosed ,

DATEVALUE(ClosedDate ) &gt; Project_Due_Date__c )</formula>
    <formulaTreatBlanksAs>BlankAsZero</formulaTreatBlanksAs>
    <label>Case Not Closed On-Time</label>
